  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>I’m thrilled to announce that after being released only in audio and digital format, my newest book, How to Survive a Pandemic, is now available for paperback pre-order and will be out on August 18. <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-to-survive-a-pandemic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pre-order</a> it today! (As always, all proceeds from my books are donated to charity).</p>\n<p>My videos on pandemics and COVID-19 are currently rolling out on NutritionFacts.org. But, if you want to see them all at once, you can get the digital download FREE for a limited time. Download the videos <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/how-to-survive-a-pandemic-digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/how-to-survive-a-pandemic-digital\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>If you haven’t seen it yet, we’ve put up a resource page all about COVID-19 with videos, links to my pandemic blog post and special Q&amp;A sessions, my DIY hand sanitizer recipes, and more. Check it out <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/covid-19/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. I’ve also continued to do a bunch of interviews, with <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_CR-buWx4rY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_CR-buWx4rY\">Dr. Neal Barnard</a> of PCRM, and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=auZDWTMLM8I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=auZDWTMLM8I\">Rich Roll</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Last Day to Register for B12 Webinar</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-63698 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG-1024x991.png\" alt=\"B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG\" width=\"207\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG-1024x991.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG-960x930.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG-768x744.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG-720x697.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG-540x523.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/B12_recommendation_webinar_promotional_IG.png 1134w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 207px) 100vw, 207px\"/></a>My next webinar on my latest vitamin B12 recommendations is happening June 26 at 2pm ET, and registration closes tomorrow, June 19. </p>\n<p>I’ll start out with a discussion of the symptoms of B12 deficiency and then explain how I arrived at what I consider the optimal dose of vitamin B12 supplements in children, adults, the elderly, and during pregnancy. I’ll clarify why cyanocobalamin (<em>not</em> methylcobalamin) is the best type of vitamin B12 supplement and address the data suggesting B12 supplements cause acne, bone fractures, and lung cancer. I’ll also cover the healthiest food sources of B12 for those who don’t want to take supplements. And of course, I’ll be answering your questions during the Q&amp;A portion. I hope you’ll join me!</p>\n<p><strong>Update:</strong> Thank you to everyone who attended the webinar. The digital download of the videos from the webinar is now available on <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/b12-recommendations-digital\">DrGreger.org</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Saying Farewell to Physical DVDs</h4>\n<div><p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-64198 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG-1024x1023.png\" alt=\"DVD Final Sale \" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG-1024x1023.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG-960x959.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG-768x767.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG-720x719.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/DVD-Final-Sale-Colorful-IG.png 1081w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>After 12 years of putting out a DVD for every one of my 50+ volumes of videos (and before that VHS!), we are retiring these physical DVDs with a 20% off sale. This the last chance to grab any that you’d like to have, but don’t worry — we will still be offering the digital downloads of all past and future volumes. </p>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"534\" height=\"173\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px\"/></a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-63716 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Stainless Steel or Cast Iron: Which Cookware Is Best? Is Teflon Safe?\" width=\"205\" height=\"115\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/51-2-Stainless-Steel-or-Cast-Iron-Which-Cookware-Is-Best-Is-Teflon-Safe.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 205px) 100vw, 205px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/stainless-steel-or-cast-iron-which-cookware-is-best-is-teflon-safe/\">Stainless Steel or Cast Iron: Which Cookware Is Best? Is Teflon Safe?</a> <p></p>\n<p>What’s the best type of pots and pans to use?</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-63019 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"How to Lower Lp(a) with Diet\" width=\"206\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/05/50-14.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 206px) 100vw, 206px\"/></a><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-to-lower-lpa-with-diet/\">How to Lower Lp(a) with Diet</a><p></p>\n<p>What to eat and what to avoid to lower the cardiovascular disease risk factor lipoprotein(a).</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-63930 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock-1024x576.png\" alt=\"The Last Coronavirus Pandemic May Have Been Caused by Livestock\" width=\"205\" height=\"115\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock-1024x576.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock-960x540.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock-768x432.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock-480x270.png 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock-1200x675.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock-720x405.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock-540x304.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/06/4-–-The-Last-Coronavirus-Pandemic-May-Have-Been-Caused-by-Livestock.png 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 205px) 100vw, 205px\"/></a><a title=\"The Last Coronavirus Pandemic May Have Been Caused by Livestock\" href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-last-coronavirus-pandemic-may-have-been-caused-by-livestock/\">The Last Coronavirus Pandemic May Have Been Caused by Livestock</a><p></p>\n<p>The next coronavirus pandemic may come from pigs not pangolins.</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;As June 25</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Every month I do Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <em><strong>June 25</strong></em> is the day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At 12:00 p.m. ET go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At 1:00 p.m. ET go <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can now find links to all of my past live Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://nutritionfacts.org/audio.</a></p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b><p></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>"
